      </geography>
      <notes>
        <para>Shallow bay, resident green turtles.</para>
      </notes>
    </site>
    <site id="site-019fec36-b8a8-734b-84c1-66963865e729">
      <name>Ras Mohammed - Shark &amp; Yolanda</name>
      <geography>
        <location>Sinai, Red Sea</location>
      </geography>
      <notes>
        <para>Drift along two pinnacles, toilets at the Yolanda wreck.</para>
      </notes>
    </site>
    <site id="site-019fec36-b8b1-7af6-936f-d40e7cc3cf36">
      <name>Small Brother</name>
      <geography>
        <location>Brothers Islands, Red Sea</location>
      </geography>
      <notes>
        <para>Steep walls, chance of thresher sharks.</para>
      </notes>
    </site>
    <site id="site-019fec36-b89a-773e-b886-44717fc4d19f">
      <name>SS Thistlegorm</name>
      <geography>
        <location>Sha'ab Ali, Red Sea</location>
      </geography>
      <notes>
        <para>WWII wreck at ~30 m. Motorbikes in hold no. 2.</para>
      </notes>
    </site>
